9e2ee51b31854","articleSourceOrder":18,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.6586f8baeb68b492b25d2637","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-conditional-statements#if%20%E5%B5%8C%E5%A5%97~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-conditional-statements","order":8,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"if 嵌套","titleDisplay":"if 嵌套","titlePath":["Python3 条件控制","if 嵌套"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"section","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-conditional-statements.html","sourceSha256":"0c0740c627d592a3b75e51aa81f0588714ad8b69be8b6f0857b9e2ee51b31854","articleSourceOrder":18,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.c60d037e6b042a5944056677","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":true,"activityId":"py3.practice.nested-if","exampleId":"py3.section.c60d037e6b042a5944056677.example","questionId":"py3.practice.nested-if","status":"authored","goal":"把只在某条路径上需要的第二个判断放入对应代码块。","body":["先检查气温。气温低于 5 度时，直接输出保暖衣物的建议。只有不够冷时才进入外层的 else，再根据是否下雨选择雨具。这样内层条件只在需要区分两种出行情况时执行。","内层的 else 与内层 if 对齐，它们都比外层的 else 多缩进一层。回放时，先停在外层分支节点，再观察冷天是否绕过内层判断。把内层 else 向左移动会改变它归属的判断。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-conditional-statements#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~5","parent":"py3-source/python3-conditional-statements","order":9,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 条件控制","实例"],"titleOccurrence":5,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-conditional-statements.html","sourceSha256":"0c0740c627d592a3b75e51aa81f0588714ad8b69be8b6f0857b9e2ee51b31854","articleSourceOrder":18,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.84f4bf1c11ab8bc30896026c","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-conditional-statements#match...case~1","parent":"py